{"4532680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heavy Mental: A Co-op Action Roguelite", "steam_appid": 4532680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ULTIMATE METAL-INFUSED CHAOS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken as a Cyborg Soldier on a mysterious, war-torn island. Your mission? Total conquest. In Heavy Mental, you don't just fight; you lead a rolling fortress. Experience high-octane Action Roguelite combat where you seamlessly switch between lightning-fast infantry strikes and heavy vehicular warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/a94f8b886a1bd245fa19557d1a20503f.poster.avif?t=1781551207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/a94f8b886a1bd245fa19557d1a20503f.webm?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/a94f8b886a1bd245fa19557d1a20503f.mp4?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ATTACH, UPGRADE, AND DESTROY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a basic tank and expand it into the legendary Iron Snake. Scavenge the battlefield for functional trailers, attach them to your convoy, and upgrade them with a massive arsenal of weapons. From miniguns to jet boosters, every trailer adds a new layer of destruction to your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/696ddd30a935677e17dbc5ee2b093a53.poster.avif?t=1781551207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/696ddd30a935677e17dbc5ee2b093a53.webm?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/696ddd30a935677e17dbc5ee2b093a53.mp4?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE 5 FORTRESSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is guarded by 5 massive castles, each spewing waves of defenders.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Elders:</strong> Dual-wielding wheelchairs and shield-bombing commandos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Elite:</strong> Teleporting Ninjas, Flying Sumo Titans, and laser-sighted Snipers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Absurd:</strong> Find the <strong>Mecha-Schoolboy</strong> or call upon the <strong>Boxer Chicken</strong> as your feathered ally.`</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/696ddd30a935677e17dbc5ee2b093a53.poster.avif?t=1781551207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/696ddd30a935677e17dbc5ee2b093a53.webm?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/696ddd30a935677e17dbc5ee2b093a53.mp4?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ROGUE-LITE PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is unique. Loot armor, fuel, and gold from your fallen enemies. Spend your cash at the <strong>Arcade Man Shop</strong> or use the <strong>Card System</strong> upon level-up to trigger chaotic powers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tornadoes:</strong> Sweep enemies into the air with localized storms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landmines:</strong> Leave a trail of explosives behind your convoy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Tech:</strong> Boost your fire rate and speed to god-like levels.`</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/58f44596b921ec9906d88835a0e443cf.poster.avif?t=1781551207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/58f44596b921ec9906d88835a0e443cf.webm?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/58f44596b921ec9906d88835a0e443cf.mp4?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SIEGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t go alone! Team up with friends in **Online Co-Op**. Strategize your trailer placement, protect each other during intense raids, and conquer the Central Fortress together. Join the madness and make them feel the heavy metal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/b8bd670bf07ee3fae27d9d19e662c13f.poster.avif?t=1781551207\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/b8bd670bf07ee3fae27d9d19e662c13f.webm?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4532680/extras/b8bd670bf07ee3fae27d9d19e662c13f.mp4?t=1781551207\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"